algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: n×n layered matrix M
Output: depth, longest_path

dp[0..n-1] ← 0
pred[0..n-1] ← -1
for j = 0 to n-1:
    for i = 0 to j-1:
        if M[i,j] > 0 and dp[i]+1 > dp[j]:
            dp[j] ← dp[i]+1, pred[j] ← i
depth ← max(dp)
return (depth, backtrace(pred))

Time: O(n²), Space: O(n)
